@startuml kairos-access-logs-and-audit-logs-sequence
title View Access Logs and Audit Logs

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Access Logs
WebAdmin -> API: GET /security/access-logs?filters
API -> DB: SELECT AccessLog rows
DB --> API: rows
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {logs}

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Audit Log Page
WebAdmin -> API: GET /security/audit-logs?filters
API -> DB: SELECT AuditLog rows
DB --> API: rows
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {auditLogs}

WebAdmin --> Admin: Render logs tables

@enduml
